+
+## Outcome
+
+1. Welcome code refused after cancel: `OrderService.cancel` gave the coupon back under the customer's name instead of the order id, so the single-use coupon stayed marked as used. Fixed (`src/orders.ts`), regression test added.
+2. €4.90 shipping on €50.00 goods: not reproducible. `shippingCost` is free from 5000 cents (fixed in an earlier request); an end-to-end test at exactly €50.00 passes. A case where discounts bring goods below €50.00 correctly pays shipping per README. Asked support for the order if it still reproduces.
